@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Liberation Serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
hide empty members
participant "Người dùng" as P0
participant "CancelHandler" as P1
participant "EnvRepository" as P2
participant "PostgreSQL" as P3
P0 -> P1: GET link có token
P1 -> P0: trang HTML; chưa mutation
P0 -> P1: POST xác nhận
P1 -> P1: ValidCancelToken
P1 -> P2: CancelDeletion(key, now, grace)
P2 -> P3: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE
P2 -> P2: ExtendOnce kiểm tra guard
P2 -> P3: Save + COMMIT
P2 -> P1: env RUNNING
P1 -> P0: 200; TTL mới hai phút
@enduml